{"id":"n28154-1-7","stage":4,"title":"컨디션 · 状态","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n28154-1-7-1","ko":"지금 현재 컨디션은 어떤가요?","zh":"你现在的状态怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지금","meaning":"现在，这会儿","explanation":"지금：现在，这会儿。","readings":[{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62523","senseId":"1","lemma":"지금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}},{"text":"현재","meaning":"现在，目前，此时","explanation":"현재：现在，目前，此时。","readings":[{"term":"현재","audio":"/audio/72d2bae2a744d54f0940.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62446","senseId":"1","lemma":"현재","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"현재","audio":"/audio/72d2bae2a744d54f0940.mp3"}},{"text":"컨디션은","meaning":"状态，气色","explanation":"컨디션：状态，气色；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"컨디션","audio":"/audio/f64da2fd6ef848dfb234.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28154","senseId":"1","lemma":"컨디션","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"컨디션은","audio":"/audio/aaaafeed7b1886419a39.mp3"}},{"text":"어떤가요?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；ㄴ가：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떤가요","audio":"/audio/23fa3a0906f95e00f157.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"df159f47a890ff65","term":"지금","zh":"现在，这会儿","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3","entryId":"62523","definition":"在说话的当时；或此时此刻。","pronunciation":["지금"]},{"id":"72d2bae2a744d54f","term":"현재","zh":"现在，目前，此时","audio":"/audio/72d2bae2a744d54f0940.mp3","entryId":"62446","definition":"现在这个时候。","pronunciation":["현ː재"]},{"id":"f64da2fd6ef848df","term":"컨디션","zh":"状态，气色","audio":"/audio/f64da2fd6ef848dfb234.mp3","entryId":"28154","definition":"身体或健康，心里等的状况。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/48b48281aeb55577a847.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n28154-1-7-2","ko":"어제 잠을 잘 자서 상쾌하고 아주 좋아요.","zh":"我昨天睡得很好，所以精神饱满，感觉非常好。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어제","meaning":"昨天，昨日","explanation":"어제：昨天，昨日。","readings":[{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67075","senseId":"1","lemma":"어제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}},{"text":"잠을","meaning":"觉，睡眠","explanation":"잠：觉，睡眠；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"잠","audio":"/audio/699e97260979403d2584.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70078","senseId":"1","lemma":"잠","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잠을","audio":"/audio/76afcb272f116ce8b9ef.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"好好地，顺利地","explanation":"잘：好好地，顺利地。","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"4","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"자서","meaning":"睡，睡觉","explanation":"자다：睡，睡觉；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"자다","audio":"/audio/023aa5fb341789792a99.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69511","senseId":"1","lemma":"자다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자서","audio":"/audio/95f23d1ddc68e5d226ac.mp3"}},{"text":"상쾌하고","meaning":"清爽，清新","explanation":"상쾌하다：清爽，清新；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"상쾌하다","audio":"/audio/e6de708c58b3dd5edd6a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16227","senseId":"1","lemma":"상쾌하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"상쾌하고","audio":"/audio/f53de9b82527ad1b32bd.mp3"}},{"text":"아주","meaning":"非常，极其，很","explanation":"아주：非常，极其，很。","readings":[{"term":"아주","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72484","senseId":"1","lemma":"아주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아주","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3"}},{"text":"좋아요.","meaning":"好，良好","explanation":"좋다：好，良好；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"4","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋아요","audio":"/audio/4e89f12afd275d8a286b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"79c5ada11647bce6","term":"어제","zh":"昨天，昨日","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3","entryId":"67075","definition":"今天的前一天。","pronunciation":["어제"]},{"id":"699e97260979403d","term":"잠","zh":"觉，睡眠","audio":"/audio/699e97260979403d2584.mp3","entryId":"70078","definition":"指闭上眼睛，停止身体、精神活动而休息一会儿的状态。","pronunciation":["잠"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"好好地，顺利地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"没有任何问题而舒服地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"023aa5fb34178979","term":"자다","zh":"睡，睡觉","audio":"/audio/023aa5fb341789792a99.mp3","entryId":"69511","definition":"闭眼睛，停止身体、精神活动，一时进入休息状态。","pronunciation":["자다"]},{"id":"e6de708c58b3dd5e","term":"상쾌하다","zh":"清爽，清新","audio":"/audio/e6de708c58b3dd5edd6a.mp3","entryId":"16227","definition":"心情或感觉等清凉而爽快。","pronunciation":["상ː쾌하다"]},{"id":"dc76f888ddfaef28","term":"아주","zh":"非常，极其，很","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3","entryId":"72484","definition":"表示程度相当高，远远超出了一般程度。","pronunciation":["아주"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，良好","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"身体条件或健康状态等高于一般人。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/52691523befc7f5f0989.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.582,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=28154","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","